start3 ..> ads4 : [runtime.ads] startup
start3 ..> adsServer2 : [runtime.ads_server] startup
step3 ..> ads7 : apply ADS read cache\n+ _quality globals
step8 ..> ads7 : queue ADS writes\n+ _quality globals
